<title>USA: Insignia sees Q4 loss.</title>
<headline>Insignia sees Q4 loss.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Insignia Solutions Plc said continued weakness in sales of its SoftWindows product line resulted in lower than expected revenues and is expected to cause Insignia to report a loss for the fourth quarter ended December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>It said it expects to report revenues comparable to those reported for the third quarter of 1996 and, as a result of expense control measures and improved margins, incrementally better operating results than the previous quarter.</p>
<p>The company expects to report fourth quarter and year-end 1996 financial results during the first week of February 1997.</p>
</text>
